1. At the moment I'm working for a small web/app development agency remotely on the position of Project Manager.
On a daily basis I coordinate the development process of several middle-sized projects (web & apps) simultaneously, provide project development plans and discuss with clients their requirements regarding the expected results.

2. I worked at Compliance Department for Amazon in Gdańsk.
In internal system & Microsoft Excel I classified hazardous chemical products which are stored at warehouses based on description information found online and especially in documents (Safety Data Sheets) intentionally prepared for such goods according to CLP & GHS regulations.

3. I worked for P2H in Kharkov.
I managed the development team (both on-site & remote) and processed multiple HTML/CSS/JavaScript projects run at the same time.

Including:
- preliminary estimation of the projects' duration & possible pitfalls;
- checking the description available for a project;
- clarifying & discussing the details with clients (calls, texting, chats) and turning their expectations into technical requirements;
- making suggestions regarding the project output during the development;
- allocation the development roles & tasks between teammates;
- control of fulfillment;
- compatibility testing, bug reporting;
- delivery management (making sure all the major/sensible points requested by the client are done and work smoothly & project is delivered on time).

